    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The 2nd EyeSurg Tournament was arranged on September 16, 2022, by CIME in partnership with the Department of Ophthalmology and Visual Sciences. The tournament was held as part of Healthcare Simulation Week 2022. The aim was to engage residents and students in a competitive safe learning environment where they can practice eye surgery and improve their surgical skills on CIME's EyeSi simulator - the first of its kind in Pakistan.",
